				<wikidot:authorName>That Other Guy</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1363687</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">It&nbsp;mostly&nbsp;makes&nbsp;sense&nbsp;to&nbsp;me...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">I&nbsp;think...</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>So 239 is the reality bender at the start, possibly, and it's checking out 321 for some reason. She's reminded of something and hops outside of time to track down what even is the deal. She finds the fairies outside of existence prior to their annihilation as a result of the deal made with the Factory in Brights 001. She informs them of their coming destruction and takes their Queen outside of time, to beyond the point of their defeat, giving her 321's body, which she uses to allow the fairies back into the universe.</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>Did I win?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
